    "answer": "Seattle, City Of Seattle",
    "mnemonic": "The name of the city (<ja>シアトル／しあとる</ja>) with a <kanji><ja>市</ja></kanji> attached to it means it is \"the city of ____.\" You can do this with any city (try it out on your hometown!). So this word means <vocabulary>Seattle</vocabulary>, or more specifically <vocabulary>City of Seattle</vocabulary>.",
